 assert set(mapping)==set(range(1,85))
 key_flow=flow('A secure key-generation or key-derivation process.','Software produces key material suitable for the selected cryptographic scheme.','A digital key: data represented as bits, handled in memory, protected storage, or specialized hardware.','An encryption or signing operation receives the key as an input that controls its operation. Keep secret keys protected; merely displaying a key does not encrypt a file.')
